{"id":"ba4cb91640","t":"I’ll Be Anything You Desire","c":"cv","n":54,"l":53,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire"},"u":1795288489286,"desc":"بعد أن خانها خطيبها وصديقتها، أُسرت، وتحولت من أميرة إلى جارية. بيعت روكسانا فرانش ووُسمت بعلامة العبودية، ووجدت الخلاص على غير المتوقع في رجل جاء يحمل نارًا كالوحش. قال: “يا صاحب السمو، أتمنى لك حياة رغيدة، وطعامًا وفيرًا، ونومًا هانئًا في هذا القصر الهادئ والجميل”. وأنا، التي كنت أتوسل إليه حتى أصبحت امرأة وأصبح لي الحق في الموت، قلت: “حسنًا يا صاحب السمو. اصنع إصبعي إن شئت. كُل شيئًا وابتلعه، حتى يمنعك قانوني على الأقل من رفع صوتك ضد سخريتي”. “لماذا الإصرار على محاولة الانكماش؟”","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","تاريخ","دراما","رومانسى","شوجو"],"src":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/1/"},"2":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/2/"},"3":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/3/"},"4":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/4/"},"5":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/5/"},"6":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/6/"},"7":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/7/"},"8":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/8/"},"9":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/9/"},"10":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/10/"},"11":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/11/"},"12":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/12/"},"13":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/13/"},"14":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/14/"},"15":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anything-you-desire/15/"},"16":{"ml":"ill-be-anything-you-desire|/manga/ill-be-anyth